  "name": "27 100 MW Fuel Cell Data Center — BESS + N+1 Diesel Backup",
  "description": "Islanded 100 MW data-center microgrid with a deterministic Kubernetes/Slurm/Ray workload staircase: approximately 2 MW background, 10 MW, 30 MW, 70 MW peak, 50 MW, 15 MW, then 2 MW background again. Each step lasts 3 minutes. The workload is supplied by a 100 MW fuel-cell array, a 25 MW / 25 MWh grid-forming LFP BESS, and a 110 MW N+1 diesel backup plant. No utility import, solar, or gas-turbine generation is configured.",
